ates that the moment of inertia of the lamina about a line $l$ parallel to ${l}_{M}$ is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{l}={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M,\n$$\n\nwhere $d$ is the distance between the lines, and ${I}_{M}$ and ${I}_{l}$ are the moments of inertia about the lines ${l}_{M}$ and $l,$ respectively.\n\nApplying the parallel axis theorem and solving for $d,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & ={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M \\\\ 0.25 & =0.2+0.5{d}^{2} \\\\ 0.5{d}^{2} & =0.05 \\\\ {d}^{2} & =0.1 \\\\ d & =0.316\\,22….\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the distance between the two axes is $0.32\\,m,$ rounded to two decimal places." 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370991 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370992 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370993 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370994 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1000 #edb/ref 17592186370995 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1041 "selection" 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1104 #edb/ref 17592186370992 13194139535862 true] [17592186370990 1110 #uuid "1d938f87-ae50-59b4-a944-653d39f85756" 13194139535862 true] [17592186370991 1034 "\\frac{14}{5}\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186370991 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186370991 1111 #uuid "405db70d-d40f-5e2e-9152-8ebb91470814" 13194139535862 true] [17592186370992 1034 "\\frac{44}{15}\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186370992 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186370992 1111 #uuid "3c64760d-c517-5f94-b9ad-04a905be0e59" 13194139535862 true] [17592186370993 1034 "\\frac{16}{5}\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186370993 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186370993 1111 #uuid "c05424b5-db70-50b5-bf5b-dcdb39137ad8" 13194139535862 true] [17592186370994 1034 "\\frac{9}