 moments of inertia about the lines ${l}_{M}$ and $l,$ respectively.\n\nThe distance between the line through the center of mass $(3,1)$ and the line through the point $(1,-1)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =\\sqrt{(3-1)^{2}+(1-(-1))^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{8} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, applying the parallel axis theorem, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{l} & =2+(2\\sqrt{2})^{2}\\cdot 0.8 \\\\  & =2+6.4 \\\\  & =8.4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia is $8.4\\,kg\\cdot {m}^{2}.$" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371039 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371040 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371041 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371042 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371043 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1041 "selection" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1104 #edb/ref 17592186371041 13194139535862 true] [17592186371038 1110 #uuid "8db2c00e-700d-5060-995f-06579c8a5e38" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371039 1034 "10.1\\,kg\\cdot {m}^{2}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371039 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186371039 1111 #uuid "a876db2a-bd63-54e5-8635-3ec253de5748" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371040 1034 "12.3\\,kg\\cdot {m}^{2}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371040 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186371040 1111 #uuid "b2fc490d-fb6d-5338-95e7-a5b75e680903" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371041 1034 "8.4\\,kg\\cdot {m}^{2}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371041 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186371041 1111 #uuid "5b2bcc4f-77d7-5644-91f5-c198913a0200" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371042 1034 "6.8\\,kg\\cdot {m}^{2}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371042 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186371042 1111 #uuid "aadc105