stance of the line $l$ from the center of mass." 13194139535862 true] [17592186371100 1113 #uuid "2530e161-4473-52c3-bf05-108490fabea7" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371100 1145 "For a plane lamina of mass $M$ and a line ${l}_{M}$ perpendicular to the lamina passing through its center of mass, the parallel axis theorem states that the moment of inertia of the lamina about a line $l$ parallel to ${l}_{M}$ is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{l}={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M,\n$$\n\nwhere $d$ is the distance between the lines, and ${I}_{M}$ and ${I}_{l}$ are the moments of inertia about the lines ${l}_{M}$ and $l,$ respectively.\n\nFirst, we find the mass of the plate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}4xy\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{3}x\\,\\text{d}x{\\int }_{0}^{1}y\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\,{|}_{0}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{y}^{2}\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{9}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =9\\,\\text{kg}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, the moment of inertia about the perpendicular line through the center of mass $(2,\\frac{2}{3})$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{M} & ={∬}_{D}((x-\\overset{―}{x})^{2}+(y-\\overset{―}{y})^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}((x-2)^{2}+{(y-\\frac{2}{3})}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}((x-2)^{2}+{(y-\\frac{2}{3})}^{2})\\cdot 4xy\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1}x(x-2)^{2}y+x{y}^{3}-\\frac{4}{3}x{y}^{2}+\\frac{4}{9}xy\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{3}{[\\frac{1}{2}x(x-2)^{2}{y}^{2}+\\frac{1}{4}x{y}^{4}-\\frac{4}{9}x{y}^{3}+\\frac{2}{9}x{y}^{2}]}_{y=0}^{y=1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{1}{2}x(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{1}{4}x-\\frac{4}{9}x+\\frac{2}{9}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{3}\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+\\frac{73}{36}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{[\\frac{1}{8}{x}^{4}-\\frac{2}{3}{x}^{3}+\\frac{73}{72}{x}^{2}]}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =4(\\frac{81}{8}-18+\\frac{73}{8}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{5}{4} \\\\  & =5\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, applying the parallel axis theorem and solving for $d,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & ={I}_{M}+{d}^{2}M \\\\ \\frac{16}{3} & =5+9{d}^{2} \\\\ 9{d}^{2} & =\\frac{1}{3} \\\\ {d}^{2} & =\\frac{1}{27} \\\\ d & =\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{3}} \\\\ d & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{9}\\,\\text{m}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371102 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371103 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371104 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371105 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186371106 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1041 "selection" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1104 #edb/ref 17592186371104 13194139535862 true] [17592186371101 1110 #uuid "f1cd0802-1f4a-5f5c-9beb-7ddab9580bfb" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371102 1034 "\\sqrt{6}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371102 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186371102 1111 #uuid "9b6b9860-ada7-59ef-a471-769725a3eecf" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371103 1034 "6\\,\\text{m}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371103 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186371103 1111 #uuid "06575fb5-2bce-55f1-b3da-a6f0b9dc51e9" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371104 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{9}\\,\\text{m}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371104 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186371104 1111 #uuid "98a03c3e-1561-5693-81b3-2f91c8fd8c27" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371105 1034 "4\\,\\text{m}" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371105 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535862 true] [17592186371105 1111 #uuid "6a1ba289-a9c8-5201-a1e5-2184124d5b53" 13194139535862 true] [17592186371106 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3}\\,\\t